{"id": "cefd9084-0fb5-4467-8e0d-fc3694e5db2e", "slug": "interactive-honors-showcase-1", "title": "Interactive Honors Showcase", "description": "Interactive Honors Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Interactive Honors Showcase\"\ndescription: \"Interactive Honors Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#1E1E1E\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Interactive Honors Showcase\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 35; favorites: 5; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nInteractive Honors Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nDistinction FROSTED GLASS Shift Interfaces Fluidly Alpha Channel Ready Refined and minimalist interface component preview. Ideal for dynamic presentations and visualizing complex, fluid interactions in modern digital en…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Distinction; Shift Interfaces Fluidly; Global Design Prize; Tactile Feedback Loops; Innovation Award; Depth Perception Scale.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #FFFFFF, background #050505, surface #1E1E1E, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Interactive Honors Showcase</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-zinc-200 font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-x-hidden relative py-24 selection:bg-white/10\">\n\n    <!-- Background Distant Text -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-0 select-none overflow-hidden mix-blend-screen\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-[25vw] leading-none font-medium text-white/[0.02] tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap\">Distinction</h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-5xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4\">\n\n        <!-- Interactive Card Stack Container -->\n        <div id=\"card-stack\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-[420px] aspect-[4/4.5] perspective-1000\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1 -->\n            <div class=\"swipe-card absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-[#1e1e1e] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 flex flex-col p-5 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] origin-bottom-right touch-none select-none cursor-grab\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-[45%] bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.05] flex items-center justify-center group/inner shrink-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-40 transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover/inner:scale-110 group-hover/inner:rotate-2\" style=\"background-image: repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 0, transparent 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 4px), radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 0% 100%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0%, transparent 50%); background-size: 100% 100%, 150% 150%, 150% 150%;\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a0a0a] via-transparent to-transparent z-10\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-20 bg-white text-black w-48 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center shadow-xl transition-transform duration-500 group-hover/inner:scale-105 group-hover/inner:-translate-y-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.5rem] font-normal text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">FROSTED GLASS</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center w-full mb-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 mb-1 w-full justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:programming-linear\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight leading-none text-left\">Shift<br>Interfaces<br>Fluidly</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-zinc-200 rounded-md px-2 py-1 mb-3 w-full\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[0.6rem] font-normal text-zinc-600 block\">Alpha Channel Ready</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <hr class=\"border-white/10 my-4 shrink-0\" />\n\n                <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 font-normal leading-relaxed flex-grow\">\n                    Refined and minimalist interface component preview. Ideal for dynamic presentations and visualizing complex, fluid interactions in modern digital environments.\n                </p>\n\n                <hr class=\"border-white/10 mb-4 shrink-0\" />\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col px-1 shrink-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight uppercase\">Global Design Prize</h2>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mt-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 font-normal\">[Nexus Platform]</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 font-normal\">2025</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2 -->\n            <div class=\"swipe-card absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-[#1a1a1a] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 flex flex-col p-5 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] origin-bottom-right touch-none select-none cursor-grab\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-[45%] bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.05] flex items-center justify-center group/inner shrink-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-30 transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover/inner:scale-110 group-hover/inner:rotate-2\" style=\"background-image: repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 0, transparent 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 4px), radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 0% 100%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0%, transparent 50%); background-size: 100% 100%, 150% 150%, 150% 150%;\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a0a0a] via-transparent to-transparent z-10\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-20 bg-white text-black w-48 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center shadow-xl transition-transform duration-500 group-hover/inner:scale-105 group-hover/inner:-translate-y-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.5rem] font-normal text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">HAPTIC ENGINE</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center w-full mb-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 mb-1 w-full justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight leading-none text-left\">Tactile<br>Feedback<br>Loops</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-zinc-200 rounded-md px-2 py-1 mb-3 w-full\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[0.6rem] font-normal text-zinc-600 block\">Seamless Integration</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <hr class=\"border-white/10 my-4 shrink-0\" />\n\n                <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 font-normal leading-relaxed flex-grow\">\n                    Award-winning kinetic framework prioritizing micro-interactions and tactile resonance, elevating the standard for user immersion.\n                </p>\n\n                <hr class=\"border-white/10 mb-4 shrink-0\" />\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col px-1 shrink-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight uppercase\">Innovation Award</h2>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mt-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 font-normal\">[Aura System]</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 font-normal\">2024</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3 -->\n            <div class=\"swipe-card absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-[#161616] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 flex flex-col p-5 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] origin-bottom-right touch-none select-none cursor-grab\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-[45%] bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.05] flex items-center justify-center group/inner shrink-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover/inner:scale-110 group-hover/inner:rotate-2\" style=\"background-image: repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 0, transparent 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 4px), radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 0% 100%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0%, transparent 50%); background-size: 100% 100%, 150% 150%, 150% 150%;\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a0a0a] via-transparent to-transparent z-10\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-20 bg-white text-black w-48 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center shadow-xl transition-transform duration-500 group-hover/inner:scale-105 group-hover/inner:-translate-y-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.5rem] font-normal text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">SPATIAL UI</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center w-full mb-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 mb-1 w-full justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight leading-none text-left\">Depth<br>Perception<br>Scale</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-zinc-200 rounded-md px-2 py-1 mb-3 w-full\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[0.6rem] font-normal text-zinc-600 block\">Z-Axis Empowered</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <hr class=\"border-white/10 my-4 shrink-0\" />\n\n                <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 font-normal leading-relaxed flex-grow\">\n                    A multi-layered graphical paradigm built to support complex data mapping. Showcasing pristine depth hierarchy for enterprise tooling.\n                </p>\n\n                <hr class=\"border-white/10 mb-4 shrink-0\" />\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col px-1 shrink-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight uppercase\">Excellence Badge</h2>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mt-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 font-normal\">[Zenith App]</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 font-normal\">2023</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Divider Section -->\n        <div class=\"w-full mt-32 flex flex-col items-center\">\n            <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm md:text-base font-normal tracking-wide text-center px-4\">\n                Crafting distinct digital solutions for <span class=\"text-zinc-100 font-normal\">global partners</span>.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent mt-8\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Mentions/Awards Grid -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-3xl mt-12 px-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-8 md:gap-x-14 gap-y-8 md:gap-y-10 items-center\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-start group cursor-pointer text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:cssdesignawards\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <sup class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 ml-1 mt-1 font-normal transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-zinc-400\">01</sup>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-start group cursor-pointer text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:dribbble\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <sup class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 ml-1 mt-1 font-normal transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-zinc-400\">02</sup>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-start group cursor-pointer text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:awwwards\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <sup class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 ml-1 mt-1 font-normal transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-zinc-400\">03</sup>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-start group cursor-pointer text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:figma\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <sup class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 ml-1 mt-1 font-normal transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-zinc-400\">04</sup>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-start group cursor-pointer text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:greensock\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <sup class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 ml-1 mt-1 font-normal transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-zinc-400\">05</sup>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-start group cursor-pointer text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:react\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <sup class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 ml-1 mt-1 font-normal transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-zinc-400\">06</sup>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const stack = document.getElementById('card-stack');\n            let cards = Array.from(stack.querySelectorAll('.swipe-card'));\n\n            let isDragging = false;\n            let startX = 0;\n            let startY = 0;\n            let currentX = 0;\n            let currentY = 0;\n\n            function updateStack() {\n                cards.forEach((card, i) => {\n                    card.style.transition = 'transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1), opacity 0.5s';\n                    card.style.opacity = '1';\n                    card.style.cursor = 'grab';\n\n                    if (i === 0) {\n                        card.style.zIndex = 30;\n                        card.style.transform = 'translateX(0) translateY(0) rotate(0) scale(1)';\n                    } else if (i === 1) {\n                        card.style.zIndex = 20;\n                        card.style.transform = 'translateX(0.75rem) translateY(0.25rem) rotate(2deg) scale(0.98)';\n                    } else if (i === 2) {\n                        card.style.zIndex = 10;\n                        card.style.transform = 'translateX(1.5rem) translateY(0.5rem) rotate(4deg) scale(0.96)';\n                    } else {\n                        card.style.zIndex = 0;\n                        card.style.opacity = '0';\n                        card.style.transform = 'translateX(2rem) translateY(1rem) rotate(6deg) scale(0.94)';\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            updateStack();\n\n            stack.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => {\n                isDragging = true;\n                startX = e.clientX;\n                startY = e.clientY;\n                const frontCard = cards[0];\n                frontCard.style.transition = 'none';\n                frontCard.style.cursor = 'grabbing';\n                frontCard.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n            });\n\n            stack.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                currentX = e.clientX - startX;\n                currentY = e.clientY - startY;\n                const frontCard = cards[0];\n                const rotate = currentX * 0.05;\n                frontCard.style.transform = `translate(${currentX}px, ${currentY}px) rotate(${rotate}deg) scale(1)`;\n            });\n\n            stack.addEventListener('pointerup', (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                const frontCard = cards[0];\n                frontCard.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                frontCard.style.cursor = 'grab';\n\n                if (Math.abs(currentX) > 100) {\n                    const throwX = currentX > 0 ? window.innerWidth : -window.innerWidth;\n                    frontCard.style.transition = 'transform 0.4s ease-out, opacity 0.4s ease-out';\n                    frontCard.style.transform = `translate(${throwX}px, ${currentY + (currentX > 0 ? 100 : -100)}px) rotate(${currentX * 0.1}deg)`;\n                    frontCard.style.opacity = '0';\n\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        stack.appendChild(frontCard);\n                        cards.push(cards.shift());\n                        updateStack();\n                    }, 400);\n                } else {\n                    updateStack();\n                }\n                currentX = 0;\n                currentY = 0;\n            });\n\n            stack.addEventListener('pointercancel', (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                updateStack();\n                currentX = 0;\n                currentY = 0;\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "interactive-honors-showcase-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/interactive-honors-showcase-1.jpg", "source_name": "interactive-honors-showcase-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 45, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T06:00:44.776739+00:00"}